legend right
  |= arrow |= meaning |
  | solid | Cargo/runtime code dependency (verified use/call site) |
  | dashed | compile-time types, dev-only, dynamic import, or file handoff |
  | blue bold | cross-language child-process spawn |
  Folded (not drawn): 9 service crates -> domain; api-server,
  api-server-auth, market-data, selector -> auth.
  Stream delta: lease mutations and authenticated latest-value SSE use
  the existing API, job-queue and kis-client packages. The runner selects
  REST or WS exclusively; WS has separate protected state/anchors.
  API/Web have no market-provider or WS-state mount edge. EOD Raw/Curated
  paths remain separate. Diagram describes code, not live activation.
  Evidence for folded edges is in this file's header comment.
  All drawn edges carry a "' evidence:" comment in this file's source.
